{"title": "True Hero of Baldur's Gate", "pageid": 32353, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/True_Hero_of_Baldur's_Gate", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">True Hero of Baldur's Gate</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"True Hero of Baldur's Gate.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png/300px-True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png/300px-True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png/600px-True_Hero_of_Baldur%27s_Gate.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"True Hero of Baldur's Gate.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"500\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Just_Look_At_Those_Cheekbones!_(Condition)\" title=\"Just Look At Those Cheekbones! (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Just Look At Those Cheekbones!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Just_Look_At_Those_Cheekbones!_(Condition)\" title=\"Just Look At Those Cheekbones! (Condition)\"><b>Just Look At Those Cheekbones!</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Gazing upon this depiction of themselves will <a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Stone_Features_(Condition)\" title=\"Sweet Stone Features (Condition)\">bless</a> the owner of this statue once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.</p></div></div></li><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invulnerable\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Ketheric_Invulnerable_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerable_(Condition)\" title=\"Invulnerable (Condition)\"><b>Invulnerable</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Affected entity is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>True Hero of Baldur's Gate</b> is a <i>Stoney and Boney</i> bespoke statue, commissioned from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boney\" title=\"Boney\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Portrait_Boney.png/25px-Portrait_Boney.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Portrait_Boney.png/38px-Portrait_Boney.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Portrait_Boney.png/50px-Portrait_Boney.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Boney\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Portrait_Boney.png/25px-Portrait_Boney.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Portrait_Boney.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Boney\" title=\"Boney\">Boney</a> and crafted by his wife <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stoney\" title=\"Stoney\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Stoney.png/25px-Portrait_Stoney.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Stoney.png/38px-Portrait_Stoney.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Stoney.png/50px-Portrait_Stoney.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stoney\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Portrait_Stoney.png/25px-Portrait_Stoney.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Portrait_Stoney.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stoney\" title=\"Stoney\">Stoney</a> at their stall in the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>This statue costs 5,000 gold, and depicts whichever character is speaking to Boney when the purchase is made. Only a single statue can be purchased through the course of any given playthrough. It is possible to choose through dialogue to have the statue depicting the character armed (including their head gear), in their camp clothing, or in the nude.\n</p><p>While the statue is in camp, the owner gains <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Stone_Features_(Condition)\" title=\"Sweet Stone Features (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sweet Stone Features\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Stone_Features_(Condition)\" title=\"Sweet Stone Features (Condition)\">Sweet Stone Features</a> after a long rest. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/38px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/50px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dark Urge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a> characters receive the inspiration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_One#First_of_Many\" title=\"Haunted One\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"First of Many\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_One#First_of_Many\" title=\"Haunted One\">First of Many</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternative_names\">Alternative names</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Astarion the Sensuous</li>\n<li>Gale the Erudite</li>\n<li>Halsin the Immense</li>\n<li>Jaheira the Spring Chicken</li>\n<li>Karlach the Fierce</li>\n<li>Lae'zel the Stern</li>\n<li>Minsc the Hamstersome</li>\n<li>Minthara the Relentless</li>\n<li>Shadowheart the Passionate</li>\n<li>Wyll the Illustrious</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to Patch 7, other sources of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\">Bless</a> could overwrite the permanent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Stone_Features_(Condition)\" title=\"Sweet Stone Features (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sweet Stone Features\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sweet_Stone_Features_(Condition)\" title=\"Sweet Stone Features (Condition)\">Sweet Stone Features</a> condition, removing it until the next long rest.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Examining the statue displays the depicted character with a stonelike texture, but with their idle animation.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714233548\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.129 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.137 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5679/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50455/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 18701/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4706/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.029/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1348457/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  127.739      1 -total\n 82.50%  105.381      1 Template:Infobox_creature\n 57.46%   73.396      1 Template:Infobox_creature/internal\n 19.61%   25.044      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 12.26%   15.655      9 Template:Icon_link\n 11.63%   14.852      9 Template:Icon_text\n  9.71%   12.404     36 Template:Trim\n  9.49%   12.127      3 Template:Cond\n  8.28%   10.583      1 Template:Template_style\n  5.13%    6.552      3 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- 